@namespace SpaceSails.Client.Pages
@implements IHandleEvent
@*
    #251 · THE LOAD CHOOSER, ON ITS OWN FILE.

    THE LOAD CHOOSER (#837) — one row per gun the captain's hands can reach, with the stepper that
    says how many rounds go into each and the arrow that shows what the magazine line will read AFTER
    the press. Every figure on it is Core's; this block decides nothing.

    Moved out of SatchelPanel.razor by PURE MOTION — the block between the two fences below is the block
    that was in the panel, character for character. Every member it reads is a [Parameter] with the SAME
    NAME (a field keeps its underscore, a method arrives as a delegate under its own name, a variable the
    panel's `@if` bound arrives under the name that binding gave it), which is what lets the markup move
    without a rewrite and lets the composition splice it straight back where it came from.

    IHandleEvent repeats SatchelPanel's own override, which repeats Map.Sim.cs's: the HUD's refresh
    belongs to OnTick's 200 ms throttle, and a child that did not repeat it would put an automatic render
    back on every event in here. The .razor.css beside this file carries the four rule blocks of the
    satchel's sheet that THIS markup, and no other component in the client, renders (#1166); its scope
    is the PAGE's own (b-4dqsdx4p75, pinned in SpaceSails.Client.csproj), so every rule — the ones
    beside it and the shared kit left in SatchelPanel.razor.css — goes on matching it.

    The `@{ }` around the fences is not decoration: the block came out of a Razor CODE block, and a code
    block is where its first statements are legal. It is outside the fences, so what the composition reads
    is exactly the lines that stood in the panel.
*@
@{
@* ── MARKUP BEGINS · verbatim from SatchelPanel.razor ────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
                    <div class="satchel-sub">@SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.ChooserBlurb(loading.Pocket, loading.KindName)</div>

                    @if (loading.Picks.Count == 0)
                    {
                        <div class="satchel-empty">@SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.NothingInReachLine</div>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <div class="satchel-items">
                            @foreach (SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.Pick offering in loading.Picks)
                            {
                                SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.Pick gun = offering;
                                <div class="satchel-row">
                                    <button type="button" class="satchel-item"
                                            title="@gun.Note"
                                            @onclick="() => LoadIntoIt(gun)">
                                        <span class="satchel-item-name">
                                            🔫 @gun.Unit @gun.Now @(gun.Worked ? "→ " + gun.After : "") <span class="satchel-where">@gun.Where</span>
                                        </span>
                                        <span class="satchel-item-try">@SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.LoadLabel</span>
                                    </button>
                                    @* THE COUNT STEPPER, and it is only drawn where there is a choice to
                                       make: a row whose ceiling is nought has a refusal to say and no
                                       interesting difference between one nothing and another. *@
                                    @if (gun.Ceiling > 0)
                                    {
                                        <button type="button" class="satchel-leave"
                                                title="@SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.FewerHint"
                                                @onclick="() => NudgeShare(gun, -1)">−</button>
                                        <span class="satchel-share">@gun.Share of @gun.Pocket</span>
                                        <button type="button" class="satchel-leave"
                                                title="@SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.MoreHint"
                                                @onclick="() => NudgeShare(gun, 1)">+</button>
                                    }
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                    }

                    <button type="button" class="satchel-back"
                            @onclick="CloseTheLoadChooser">@SpaceSails.Core.SentryHandLoad.BackLabel</button>
@* ── MARKUP ENDS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
}
